       "</style><body><div id=\"sk-container-id-3\" class=\"sk-top-container\"><div class=\"sk-text-repr-fallback\"><pre>ColumnTransformer(transformers=[(&#x27;num&#x27;,\n",
       "                                 Pipeline(steps=[(&#x27;imputer&#x27;,\n",
