       "            copy\n",
       "            <span class=\"param-doc-description\">copy: bool, default=True<br><br>If True, a copy of X will be created. If False, imputation will<br>be done in-place whenever possible. Note that, in the following cases,<br>a new copy will always be made, even if `copy=False`:<br><br>- If `X` is not an array of floating values;<br>- If `X` is encoded as a CSR matrix;<br>- If `add_indicator=True`.</span>\n",
