       "            add_indicator\n",
       "            <span class=\"param-doc-description\">add_indicator: bool, default=False<br><br>If True, a :class:`MissingIndicator` transform will stack onto output<br>of the imputer's transform. This allows a predictive estimator<br>to account for missingness despite imputation. If a feature has no<br>missing values at fit/train time, the feature won't appear on<br>the missing indicator even if there are missing values at<br>transform/test time.</span>\n",
